Vulnerability Reporting
We welcome responsible disclosure of security vulnerabilities. Please report issues to: security_reports@digicert.com
Required Information:
Vulnerability description and affected system/domain
Steps to reproduce with proof of concept (if available)
Potential impact and severity assessment
Supporting evidence (screenshots, logs, etc.)
Optional Information:
Your contact details for follow-up
Mitigation suggestions
Please do not publicly disclose vulnerabilities until we've had opportunity to investigate and remediate.
Bug Bounty Program
Interested in joining our private bug bounty program? Please include your preferred contact email in your report to receive an invitation.
We will acknowledge all reports and work with you to address issues promptly. Thank you for your commitment to responsible security research.
